WEBVTT

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:19.780
I will drink and eat all the 
great power of darkness...

00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:26.050
That power is beginning to eat 
ravenously from my very own body.

00:00:27.190 --> 00:00:29.490
In order for us to survive,

00:00:29.490 --> 00:00:32.620
the only way is for us to reach perfection.

00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:35.740
The power of creation...

00:00:35.740 --> 00:00:40.280
Get me all seven Prism 
Stones as soon as possible!

00:00:40.610 --> 00:00:44.020
Jyaku-King's body is being eaten away,

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:47.130
and we'll be eaten away with him...

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:51.760
We must answer to Jyaku-King's 
will no matter what happens.

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:55.390
It's our duty as those who 
have been born to darkness.

00:00:55.390 --> 00:00:57.060
I know that.

00:00:57.670 --> 00:01:01.210
But things that I don't understand happen...

00:01:01.210 --> 00:01:02.040
Just as it happened last time...

00:01:09.810 --> 00:01:14.060
How long are you going to 
play out there, Kiriya?

00:01:17.850 --> 00:01:20.450
In any case, get the Prism Stones.

00:01:21.360 --> 00:01:23.960
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:23.960 --> 00:01:26.760
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:29.600
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:33.870
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are...</i>

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.840
<i>PRETTY CURE...!</i>

00:01:36.840 --> 00:01:39.710
<i>Out of the frying pan, into the fire</i>

00:01:39.710 --> 00:01:41.610
<i>Frankly, it's totally unbelievable</i>

00:01:42.810 --> 00:01:45.520
<i>Even in our school in our 
school uniforms, we're both</i>

00:01:45.520 --> 00:01:47.120
<i>amazingly tough</i>

00:01:48.620 --> 00:01:52.920
<i>Each time we get out of a tight spot, we both</i>

00:01:53.560 --> 00:01:55.030
<i>become stronger</i>

00:01:55.030 --> 00:01:58.800
<i>and closer</i>

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:02.800
<i>Yeah! Your best! My best! Because we're alive</i>

00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:05.370
<i>we never fail!</i>

00:02:05.640 --> 00:02:08.540
<i>Don't you know that good fortune 
comes to the gates of laughter?</i>

00:02:08.540 --> 00:02:11.410
<i>Out with the negative!</i>

00:02:11.410 --> 00:02:17.680
<i>Brighten up your life!
Try with all your might...</i>

00:02:17.680 --> 00:02:18.580
<i>Work like the devil!</i>

00:02:18.580 --> 00:02:21.290
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:24.090
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:24.090 --> 00:02:26.990
<i>We're pretty and cure cure</i>

00:02:26.990 --> 00:02:28.560
<i>Together we are</i>

00:02:28.560 --> 00:02:31.630
<i>Pretty Cure...!</i>

00:02:39.560 --> 00:02:42.360
We heard... We heard!

00:02:42.990 --> 00:02:47.610
You went to help out at a farm with Kiriya 
and the others, didn't you, Nagisa?

00:02:47.610 --> 00:02:50.100
I was asked to help...

00:02:52.330 --> 00:02:55.910
I finally got to be alone with Fuji-P,

00:02:55.910 --> 00:02:58.830
but I got so nervous that I 
couldn't say anything to him.

00:02:59.180 --> 00:03:02.250
I couldn't even use the 
Prism Love Checker either.

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:05.920
We managed to beat Zakenna 
who appeared as expected...

00:03:08.060 --> 00:03:10.570
I really am a hopeless... hopeless girl.

00:03:10.570 --> 00:03:12.370
You're so lucky...

00:03:12.650 --> 00:03:15.500
When they hear that you were 
together with Kiriya-kun,

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:17.850
I'll bet everyone will 
be so envious of you...

00:03:17.850 --> 00:03:20.020
You're so... so right.

00:03:20.020 --> 00:03:22.310
Kiriya-kun has so many fans, doesn't he?

00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:25.780
He does?

00:03:27.530 --> 00:03:30.060
We have something worse than that...

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:31.150
That's right.

00:03:31.150 --> 00:03:32.010
What's wrong?

00:03:32.010 --> 00:03:34.750
We're having tests from tomorrow!

00:03:36.980 --> 00:03:40.890
I don't want to talk about that now.

00:03:56.350 --> 00:04:00.920
"HEART-THROBBING! 
MIDTERM TESTS ARE A LOVE LABYRINTH"

00:04:01.050 --> 00:04:02.370
Are you serious!

00:04:02.370 --> 00:04:03.390
Are you really, really serious?

00:04:03.390 --> 00:04:05.650
That's the first time for you, Seiko.

00:04:06.150 --> 00:04:09.520
I'm really conscious of Kiriya-kun.

00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:13.300
Before I realize it, I find 
my eyes following him...

00:04:13.300 --> 00:04:14.750
Hasn't that happened to you before?

00:04:14.750 --> 00:04:17.150
It has... It really has.

00:04:18.210 --> 00:04:19.990
Conscious of him...

00:04:21.830 --> 00:04:24.580
No! I'm not...!

00:04:28.790 --> 00:04:30.440
You have no choice but to confess, don't you?

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:33.570
All right! This will be Seiko's 
first confession of love.

00:04:33.570 --> 00:04:36.710
Kiriya-kun's really my type,

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:39.620
but I'll do you a great service, 
Seiko. I'll let you have him.

00:04:39.620 --> 00:04:41.720
He doesn't belong to anyone!

00:04:42.650 --> 00:04:44.920
But I've never talked to him.

00:04:44.920 --> 00:04:47.450
Don't worry. Have more 
confidence in yourself.

00:04:47.730 --> 00:04:49.380
You're cute.

00:04:49.380 --> 00:04:50.980
And you're kind.

00:04:50.980 --> 00:04:53.300
And your grades are a whole 
lot better than mine.

00:04:53.610 --> 00:04:55.570
That's not true.

00:04:55.570 --> 00:04:57.580
If you would bring your grades up a little,

00:04:57.580 --> 00:04:59.340
you might be popular with the boys.

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:01.960
I'm going to do my best on the test.

00:05:02.220 --> 00:05:05.150
You know the saying, "Naseba 
naru nasaneba naranu nanimo..."

00:05:02.220 --> 00:05:05.150
(Where there's a will there's a way...)

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:06.870
It's "nanigoto" not "nanimono"!

00:05:08.090 --> 00:05:10.450
Listen to this, Yukishiro-san...

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:14.590
Seiko is about to make the ultimate 
decision of her lifetime...

00:05:14.830 --> 00:05:17.400
Decision? What are you talking about?

00:05:17.590 --> 00:05:21.100
Whether she's going to confess 
to her once-in-a-lifetime love!

00:05:21.910 --> 00:05:22.890
That's wonderful!

00:05:23.550 --> 00:05:26.380
I don't think I can...

00:05:26.590 --> 00:05:29.170
You have to be strong, Seiko.

00:05:29.170 --> 00:05:30.310
That's right...

00:05:30.310 --> 00:05:33.250
Say something, Yukishiro-san!

00:05:33.900 --> 00:05:41.140
I think it's very important 
to tell people how you feel.

00:05:42.690 --> 00:05:46.740
Just having someone like that is wonderful.

00:05:47.690 --> 00:05:50.470
Just what you'd expect from Yukishiro-san.

00:05:50.470 --> 00:05:53.330
Don't worry... We'll all be rooting for you.

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:55.090
That's right, Seiko. Do your best.

00:05:55.090 --> 00:05:57.200
If it doesn't work out, I'll be there to...

00:05:57.200 --> 00:05:59.040
Don't say something unlucky like that.

00:06:09.850 --> 00:06:10.930
Change players!

00:06:10.930 --> 00:06:12.080
Get in there, Kiriya.

00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:16.320
What's with him?

00:06:22.800 --> 00:06:25.150
All I have to do is take the ball away!

00:06:39.650 --> 00:06:40.630
Foul!

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:44.390
Didn't you hear the whistle 
calling a foul, Kiriya?

00:06:44.390 --> 00:06:45.910
What are you doing anyway?

00:06:45.910 --> 00:06:49.860
Do you think it's okay to make a dangerous 
sliding tackle from behind like that?

00:06:52.430 --> 00:06:54.370
If you had made just a little mistake, 
he would have been really badly hurt!

00:06:54.370 --> 00:06:55.560
Wait a minute!

00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:58.560
You saw his rough play, didn't you, Captain?

00:06:59.140 --> 00:07:01.220
Kiriya just started, so he 
doesn't know the difference

00:07:01.220 --> 00:07:04.490
between playing hard and a foul play yet.

00:07:04.960 --> 00:07:07.760
I'll talk to him about it later.

00:07:08.270 --> 00:07:11.900
Dangerous play is absolutely wrong...

00:07:11.900 --> 00:07:13.560
You were wrong.

00:07:15.300 --> 00:07:16.880
Let's get back to practice.

00:07:16.880 --> 00:07:18.180
Before it gets dark.

00:07:18.520 --> 00:07:20.520
Be careful from now on.

00:07:20.950 --> 00:07:25.590
We're all part of the same team, so 
we'll get to be friends eventually.

00:07:29.240 --> 00:07:33.380
We're all part of the same team, so 
we'll get to be friends eventually.

00:07:35.750 --> 00:07:37.020
Kiriya-kun...

00:07:39.420 --> 00:07:40.620
Who are you?

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:43.300
I'm sorry... Did I scare you?

00:07:43.300 --> 00:07:46.620
I'm Seiko Taniguchi... I'm a second-year 
student in the Sakura class...

00:07:46.620 --> 00:07:48.510
Please read this.

00:07:50.160 --> 00:07:55.360
You're probably used to 
getting letters like this...

00:07:55.360 --> 00:07:57.950
I don't know what you're talking about...

00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:04.800
It's a one-sided request, so it may 
be an inconvenience to you, but...

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:08.260
It sounds like a nuisance 
to me, so give me a break.

00:08:12.980 --> 00:08:14.070
Kiriya-kun!

00:08:18.810 --> 00:08:20.910
What was that anyway?

00:08:23.460 --> 00:08:25.420
Do you like to study?

00:08:25.420 --> 00:08:26.350
Kiriya-kun!

00:08:26.840 --> 00:08:30.750
You're always in here, so I thought 
you must really like to study.

00:08:30.750 --> 00:08:32.330
Yes, I do.

00:08:32.510 --> 00:08:36.660
After all, it's so exciting 
to learn something new.

00:08:36.950 --> 00:08:39.130
Is that how it is?

00:08:39.420 --> 00:08:42.530
Did you want to see me about something?

00:08:42.530 --> 00:08:43.740
No, I...

00:08:45.480 --> 00:08:49.880
I just don't know what the people 
around me are thinking...

00:08:50.640 --> 00:08:52.710
I don't know what I should do.

00:08:53.190 --> 00:08:57.300
I guess it's common not to understand what 
the people around you are thinking, but...

00:08:58.060 --> 00:09:02.440
Maybe it's because you don't make 
the effort to relate to them...

00:09:03.310 --> 00:09:08.200
For example, telling the 
other person how you feel.

00:09:08.200 --> 00:09:13.110
If you do that, I'm sure the other 
person will try his best to respond.

00:09:13.700 --> 00:09:17.480
You'll get to really care about each other,

00:09:17.480 --> 00:09:20.520
and you'll be able to be nice to 
him and even get angry with him.

00:09:21.810 --> 00:09:25.460
Isn't that how people are 
connected to each other?

00:09:26.530 --> 00:09:29.490
By the way, is your cut healed yet?

00:09:30.070 --> 00:09:31.680
It's fine.

00:09:33.040 --> 00:09:34.660
I'm glad.

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:37.420
I'm going to be up all night tonight...

00:09:37.590 --> 00:09:40.980
I'm going to cram (ichiyazuke) 
for tomorrow's test.

00:09:40.980 --> 00:09:42.230
"Ichiyazuke" (salted vegetables 
pickled overnight)...

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:44.690
It is a delicious picked vegetable mepo?

00:09:44.960 --> 00:09:48.510
No... it means that I'm going to memorize 
everything for the test in one night (ichiyazuke).

00:09:49.950 --> 00:09:53.680
Everything? In one night? You?

00:09:54.120 --> 00:09:57.040
You might as well give up and 
take me to see Mipple mepo.

00:09:57.270 --> 00:09:59.590
I don't have time for that!

00:10:01.240 --> 00:10:03.680
I want to go! I want to go! Take me to her!

00:10:03.680 --> 00:10:06.780
If you keep that up, I'll have him scold you!

00:10:12.320 --> 00:10:14.570
Listen carefully, Master Mepple!

00:10:14.570 --> 00:10:17.030
You mustn't interfere with her studies.

00:10:17.030 --> 00:10:18.840
He's here! It's Shikalp mepo!

00:10:18.840 --> 00:10:23.950
For one thing, you're either eating, 
sleeping or getting lovey-dovey with Miss Mipple!

00:10:23.950 --> 00:10:25.320
That's all you do!

00:10:25.320 --> 00:10:27.300
You must be more aware of being the 
chosen guardian from the Field of Light,

00:10:27.300 --> 00:10:30.060
and conduct yourself in the proper manner...

00:10:30.060 --> 00:10:31.250
I understand mepo.

00:10:31.250 --> 00:10:34.550
Especially lately, you're 
always being lovey-dovey

00:10:34.550 --> 00:10:37.190
with Miss Mipple no matter where you are...

00:10:37.190 --> 00:10:38.480
It's always lovey-dovey...

00:10:38.480 --> 00:10:40.460
I said I understand mepo.

00:10:40.460 --> 00:10:42.110
No! You don't understand!

00:10:42.110 --> 00:10:43.750
To begin with, the Field of Light...

00:10:43.750 --> 00:10:46.120
You're the one who's the biggest nuisance!

00:10:46.840 --> 00:10:48.420
If it's not one thing, it's another.

00:10:58.040 --> 00:10:59.880
Did you want something Poisonny?

00:11:00.140 --> 00:11:03.150
Do you enjoy spending time 
with these losers that much?

00:11:03.150 --> 00:11:07.050
I hope you're not seriously thinking 
about becoming friends with them...

00:11:07.050 --> 00:11:09.860
Stop it. I wouldn't even consider it.

00:11:09.860 --> 00:11:11.120
I wonder about that...

00:11:11.120 --> 00:11:15.880
Never mind... Because your whimsical 
school life will end tomorrow anyway.

00:11:15.880 --> 00:11:17.050
What do you mean?

00:11:17.050 --> 00:11:18.830
Just wait and see.

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:26.830
You got a perfect score!

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:27.960
That's awesome!

00:11:27.960 --> 00:11:29.270
Congratulations, Nagisa.

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:36.320
Fuji... mura-san...!

00:11:40.080 --> 00:11:41.140
Nagisa...

00:11:41.550 --> 00:11:42.820
Nagisa!

00:11:42.820 --> 00:11:47.980
Stop it, Mepple. You're supposed to 
sleep while I'm in school, aren't you?

00:11:48.530 --> 00:11:50.620
Are you still half asleep mepo?

00:11:50.620 --> 00:11:51.580
I fell asleep.

00:11:51.580 --> 00:11:53.400
It's already two in the morning!

00:11:53.620 --> 00:11:54.880
I don't believe this.

00:11:54.880 --> 00:11:56.940
You still have time until morning mepo.

00:11:56.940 --> 00:11:59.490
Okay. I'm going to sleep in my bed.

00:11:59.490 --> 00:12:00.360
Mepo!

00:12:01.040 --> 00:12:03.430
What happened to cramming mepo?

00:12:03.430 --> 00:12:05.210
It's impossible.

00:12:05.210 --> 00:12:07.840
I'll get Honoka to help with the parts 
that will come out on the test tomorrow.

00:12:08.610 --> 00:12:10.300
This is hopeless mepo.

00:12:34.620 --> 00:12:35.720
He's here.

00:12:37.320 --> 00:12:39.790
Please, Kiriya-kun... Accept the letter.

00:12:40.040 --> 00:12:46.240
You might not care, but if took a 
lot of courage for Seiko to do this.

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:49.830
All you have to do is accept it.

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:51.740
It's okay.

00:12:51.740 --> 00:12:53.980
I don't want to impose on Kiriya-kun anymore.

00:12:54.370 --> 00:12:55.800
What are you saying?

00:12:55.800 --> 00:12:59.450
It took a lot for someone as shy as 
you to even come this far, Seiko.

00:12:59.450 --> 00:13:02.790
That's right. At least you should 
let him know how you feel.

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:07.930
Even Yukishiro-san gave you encouragement.

00:13:08.600 --> 00:13:09.830
Yukishiro...

00:13:09.830 --> 00:13:13.510
And besides... You have 
to be more aggressive!

00:13:13.510 --> 00:13:15.940
You need to take a chance once in a while.

00:13:15.940 --> 00:13:17.310
I know, but...

00:13:17.900 --> 00:13:20.640
She did this for her...?

00:13:26.230 --> 00:13:27.890
What in the world am I...?

00:13:29.170 --> 00:13:31.040
Both of you... Thank you.

00:13:31.040 --> 00:13:34.350
But that's enough already... 
I'm sorry, Kiriya-kun...

00:13:34.350 --> 00:13:35.350
I can't, after all...

00:13:38.500 --> 00:13:41.040
Isn't the Girls' Division having tests today?

00:13:41.040 --> 00:13:42.150
Hurry, and get out of here!

00:13:42.530 --> 00:13:44.580
I have nothing to say to you.

00:13:44.990 --> 00:13:45.900
Just go!

00:13:50.830 --> 00:13:52.270
I overslept!

00:13:52.270 --> 00:13:55.710
Honoka! Tell me what's 
going to be on the test!

00:14:16.030 --> 00:14:18.620
Isn't that Yukishiro-san 
from the Girls' Division?

00:14:19.360 --> 00:14:22.160
What? She went storming 
over to the Boys' Division?

00:14:22.160 --> 00:14:23.910
She just left.

00:14:23.910 --> 00:14:27.140
How could she when the 
test is about to begin?

00:14:33.570 --> 00:14:34.740
Honoka-san?

00:14:35.470 --> 00:14:37.330
Why did you do that?

00:14:38.220 --> 00:14:41.820
Those girls may have been 
a little too pushy...

00:14:41.820 --> 00:14:45.020
And it may have been an inconvenience to you!

00:14:45.230 --> 00:14:47.510
But you didn't have to go that far, did you?

00:14:47.790 --> 00:14:51.690
At this rate, you'll never be able to 
learn how to get along with people!

00:14:52.150 --> 00:14:55.700
You need to have a little more consideration 
for how the other person feels...

00:14:56.050 --> 00:14:58.940
Be more caring about other people's feeling!

00:14:58.940 --> 00:15:01.170
Let's be a little more adult about this...

00:15:01.800 --> 00:15:03.260
I'm not an adult!

00:15:03.260 --> 00:15:04.940
You're absolutely right.

00:15:05.320 --> 00:15:08.120
So that girl's more important to you than me.

00:15:09.350 --> 00:15:11.420
You gave her encouragement, didn't you?

00:15:11.420 --> 00:15:14.650
When you did that, you weren't 
thinking about me, were you?

00:15:14.650 --> 00:15:19.170
Honoka didn't know that you were the boy 
that Seiko was in love with, so how could she?

00:15:19.170 --> 00:15:21.030
Is that any excuse?

00:15:21.880 --> 00:15:24.540
Thanks to you, it was a 
great inconvenience to me!

00:15:24.820 --> 00:15:27.990
You're the one who said to be considerate 
of other people's feelings aren't you?

00:15:28.350 --> 00:15:30.470
I was just...

00:15:30.470 --> 00:15:33.370
Do you understand how I feel?

00:15:33.600 --> 00:15:35.070
What are feelings anyway?

00:15:35.070 --> 00:15:36.840
Tell me what's really in my heart!

00:15:37.170 --> 00:15:39.670
If I have a heart, then 
what kind of heart is it?

00:15:40.140 --> 00:15:42.930
You don't know anything at all about me.

00:15:43.580 --> 00:15:45.560
Don't talk as if you know everything!

00:15:53.090 --> 00:15:56.040
You're right...

00:15:56.040 --> 00:15:59.430
I didn't know anything about you, Kiriya-kun.

00:15:59.680 --> 00:16:02.070
I'm so sorry.

00:16:03.890 --> 00:16:05.040
I'm sorry!

00:16:16.500 --> 00:16:18.890
It's time to start the test,

00:16:18.890 --> 00:16:21.890
so take the notebooks and textbooks off 
your desks, and put everything away.

00:16:22.310 --> 00:16:25.190
What are Nagisa and Honoka doing?

00:16:25.190 --> 00:16:26.820
They're in serious trouble!

00:16:27.480 --> 00:16:30.630
Hurry! The test will start.

00:16:30.630 --> 00:16:32.110
We'd better hurry!

00:16:34.360 --> 00:16:35.520
We made it!

00:16:37.650 --> 00:16:39.000
They're here.

00:16:39.000 --> 00:16:40.770
Hurry! Hurry!

00:16:50.680 --> 00:16:52.960
What's going on here?

00:16:54.990 --> 00:16:56.690
I've been waiting for you.

00:16:57.520 --> 00:16:59.900
So it was you, after all!

00:17:00.130 --> 00:17:02.070
Nagisa! Is Mepple here?

00:17:02.070 --> 00:17:03.130
Of course!

00:17:03.130 --> 00:17:04.500
Then let's transform!

00:17:04.760 --> 00:17:06.600
You're absolutely right!

00:17:09.310 --> 00:17:12.110
Dual Aurora Wave!

00:17:17.990 --> 00:17:20.460
Protector of the Light, Cure Black!

00:17:20.460 --> 00:17:23.050
Protector of the Light, Cure White!

00:17:25.180 --> 00:17:26.730
Together, we're Pretty Cure!

00:17:28.270 --> 00:17:30.320
Servants of the power of darkness...

00:17:31.260 --> 00:17:33.770
Go back to where you came from!

00:17:35.400 --> 00:17:37.430
Don't tell me, this is...

00:17:38.650 --> 00:17:40.020
A mirror?

00:17:40.020 --> 00:17:43.030
I'm going to get the Prism Stones 
from you today, for sure.

00:17:49.480 --> 00:17:52.310
This is going to be your grave!

00:17:59.430 --> 00:18:01.170
Black!

00:18:09.830 --> 00:18:13.040
Zakenna's not my only weapon.

00:18:13.500 --> 00:18:16.570
Hand over the Prism Stones.

00:18:25.320 --> 00:18:27.860
I'm sorry, Kiriya-kun.

00:18:28.400 --> 00:18:29.730
I'm sorry!

00:18:47.540 --> 00:18:49.380
This is so irritating!

00:18:49.590 --> 00:18:51.080
Watch out, Black!

00:18:56.130 --> 00:18:57.310
I got her!

00:18:58.050 --> 00:18:59.170
White!

00:19:09.240 --> 00:19:10.550
We did it!

00:19:15.740 --> 00:19:18.220
I won't forgive you now!

00:19:23.010 --> 00:19:25.090
What is it?

00:19:25.090 --> 00:19:27.120
Don't tell me that we're...?

00:19:27.370 --> 00:19:28.100
That's right...

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:30.190
You're inside the mirror.

00:19:30.190 --> 00:19:33.080
This is what's going to happen to you now.

00:19:37.510 --> 00:19:39.550
I absolutely refuse to forgive you this time!

00:19:39.950 --> 00:19:44.220
I'll look through the rubble, 
and find the Prism Stones later.

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:48.420
No! Don't!

00:19:48.420 --> 00:19:49.180
Let us out!

00:19:49.180 --> 00:19:50.790
Don't be hasty!

00:20:12.240 --> 00:20:13.530
They're here!

00:20:13.530 --> 00:20:15.560
Hurry! Hurry!

00:20:23.940 --> 00:20:26.100
What are doing? We're going to start.

00:20:35.370 --> 00:20:37.630
They got away? How?

00:20:37.980 --> 00:20:38.990
All right, everybody...

00:20:38.990 --> 00:20:41.350
Take your time, and work 
each problem carefully.

00:20:41.350 --> 00:20:45.950
Lately, there have been a lot of you who 
have forgotten to write their names on the test.

00:20:46.480 --> 00:20:50.080
I'm sorry about what happened 
because of what I said...

00:20:50.340 --> 00:20:52.240
No... it's okay.

00:20:52.240 --> 00:20:56.300
I was happy that everyone 
gave me encouragement.

00:20:57.620 --> 00:21:02.790
Actually, while I was waiting 
for you, I met Kiriya-kun.

00:21:04.000 --> 00:21:08.340
He came just to tell me that 
he couldn't accept my letter.

00:21:08.340 --> 00:21:10.590
And he apologized.

00:21:11.300 --> 00:21:15.590
I was a little disappointed, but 
it made me feel a little better.

00:21:16.300 --> 00:21:19.180
Thank you, Kiriya-kun.

00:21:20.790 --> 00:21:25.430
I wish you all could have seen the 
surprised look on Kiriya-kun's face.

00:21:31.390 --> 00:21:32.990
Thanks for waiting!

00:21:33.430 --> 00:21:36.660
There are a lot of good things 
in store for you from now, Seiko.

00:21:36.660 --> 00:21:38.230
What do you mean?

00:21:38.230 --> 00:21:42.240
Here... Look at this! All-you-can-eat 
chocolate parfait!

00:21:42.450 --> 00:21:44.880
The days of your youth are just beginning...

00:21:44.880 --> 00:21:45.940
If you're going to stuff 
yourself out of frustration,

00:21:45.940 --> 00:21:48.220
I'll keep you company... okay?

00:21:48.610 --> 00:21:49.880
Let's go!

00:21:50.360 --> 00:21:52.820
If we don't hurry, there 
won't be anything left.

00:21:55.990 --> 00:21:58.460
All right! I'm going to stuff myself!

00:21:59.870 --> 00:22:01.520
That Nagisa!

00:22:01.520 --> 00:22:03.820
Let's do our best on tomorrow's test!

00:22:06.290 --> 00:22:08.300
I don't want to talk about that now!

00:22:08.560 --> 00:22:10.790
Yeah! Parfait here we come!

00:22:10.790 --> 00:22:12.670
And it's chocolate parfait to boot!

00:22:13.130 --> 00:22:14.860
I'm going to stuff myself.

00:22:17.110 --> 00:22:18.840
Parfait...?

00:22:22.160 --> 00:22:25.180
<i>Ah- Let's go!</i>

00:22:26.020 --> 00:22:29.120
<i>Get you! L-O-V-E Love Love!</i>

00:22:29.120 --> 00:22:29.880
<i>Get you!</i>

00:22:29.430 --> 00:22:32.460
<i>I can't do this! I'd rather be a</i>

00:22:32.460 --> 00:22:35.500
<i>young lady than a fighter and</i>

00:22:35.500 --> 00:22:38.040
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:22:38.040 --> 00:22:42.070
<i>And melt your body and soul into sweets</i>

00:22:44.610 --> 00:22:47.850
<i>like chocolate parfait or handsome men</i>

00:22:47.850 --> 00:22:52.180
<i>I'm at the age to seriously 
fall head over heels in love</i>

00:22:52.180 --> 00:22:55.250
<i>I wanted to confess my love again today</i>

00:22:56.390 --> 00:22:59.760
<i>For the sake of the earth 
For the sake of everyone</i>

00:22:59.760 --> 00:23:06.260
<i>That's good, too, but haven't 
you forgotten something?</i>

00:23:07.370 --> 00:23:13.870
<i>I'm a teenager with a heart 
throbbing exciting dream</i>

00:23:13.870 --> 00:23:20.380
<i>I don't want to lose that 
normal everyday routine</i>

00:23:20.380 --> 00:23:23.110
<i>I just can't do this! 
It's romance rather than</i>

00:23:23.110 --> 00:23:26.350
<i>stress, isn't it?</i>

00:23:26.350 --> 00:23:28.520
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode.</i>

00:23:28.520 --> 00:23:32.120
<i>Isn't that the best source of power?</i>

00:23:32.120 --> 00:23:35.330
<i>I just can't do this! I'd rather cuddle</i>

00:23:35.330 --> 00:23:38.130
<i>than fight and...</i>

00:23:38.130 --> 00:23:40.370
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:23:40.370 --> 00:23:43.030
<i>That's the most peaceful way</i>

00:23:43.030 --> 00:23:49.610
<i>So why am I stuffing my face 
with chocolates like this?</i>

00:23:53.420 --> 00:23:55.250
Mipple and Mepple are fighting?

00:23:55.250 --> 00:23:56.230
You're kidding!

00:23:56.230 --> 00:23:58.220
That lovey-dovey couple 
will finally split up?

00:23:58.220 --> 00:23:59.020
That's impossible.

00:23:59.020 --> 00:24:00.440
We have to get them to make up right away.

00:24:00.440 --> 00:24:01.520
Let them fight once in a while.

00:24:01.520 --> 00:24:02.380
They're usually so irritating.

00:24:02.380 --> 00:24:04.200
Nagisa... Something strange 
is going on in the city.

00:24:04.200 --> 00:24:06.790
What is this potent and 
sinister power anyway?

00:24:06.790 --> 00:24:09.640
The difference between this guy 
and the others is immeasurable.

00:24:09.640 --> 00:24:11.210
Our transformation is coming undone!

00:24:13.030 --> 00:24:15.800
"TOO SCARY! 
DOTSUKU ZONE'S FINAL TRUMP CARD"

00:24:16.020 --> 00:24:17.870
Isn't there anything we can do?

00:24:17.870 --> 00:24:19.880
Don't give up, White!
